Description: Offline voice-to-text transcription with 99+ language support
 Voice to Text is a push-to-talk voice transcription application using
 OpenAI Whisper AI. It supports 99+ languages including English, Spanish,
 French, German, Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Arabic, Hindi, and more.
 .
 Features:
  - Push-to-talk recording (Scroll Lock key by default)
  - 99+ language support with automatic detection
  - Multiple Whisper model sizes (tiny to large-v3)
  - Two backends: whisper.cpp (C++) and CTranslate2 (Python, 5-10x faster)
  - GPU acceleration with NVIDIA CUDA (optional)
  - System tray integration with GTK3
  - Settings persistence
  - 100% offline operation (no internet required)
 .
 The application runs as a system tray icon and transcribes your voice
 directly into any focused application. Press and hold Scroll Lock to record,
 release to transcribe.
 .
 To enable GPU acceleration, install cuda-toolkit-12-6 and libcudnn9-cuda-12.
 To install Python transcription backend, run:
   pip3 install --break-system-packages faster-whisper ctranslate2
